package medium;public class BestTimeToBuyAndSellStockIII{public static int maxProfit(int[]p){int buy1=-p[0],sell1=0,buy2=-p[0],sell2=0;for(int i=1;i<p.length;i++){buy1=Math.max(buy1,-p[i]);sell1=Math.max(sell1,buy1+p[i]);buy2=Math.max(buy2,sell1-p[i]);sell2=Math.max(sell2,buy2+p[i]);}return sell2;}public static void main(String[]args){System.out.println("Max: "+maxProfit(new int[]{3,3,5,0,0,3,1,4}));}}
